<title>UK: KFW Finance adds 4.0 bln pesata to 20-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW Finance adds 4.0 bln pesata to 20-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Banco Central Hispano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WEIDERAUFBAU (RATED AAA/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT   *14 BLN PTA    COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    13.JAN.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE**99.35     PAY DATE    13.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 10 BLN PTA ON 02.DEC.96.</p>
<p>	    **NEW ISSUE PRICE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
